(a) The authority is authorized to be a lender in the Georgia Higher Education Loan Program as provided for in Part 2 of this article and to establish and administer educational loan program activities for the benefit of students and parents and other lenders who participate in the Georgia Higher Education Loan Program pursuant to this subpart.
